{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47749","headline":"湖南闯斋吟 · 伊用昌","name":"湖南闯斋吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁人能识白元君，上士由来尽见闻。\n避世早空南火宅，植田高种北山云。\n鸡能抱卵心常听，蝉到成形壳自分。\n学取大罗些子术，免教松下作孤坟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"伊用昌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47749.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47749","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}